<title>UK: Centrobanca sets 500 billion lire eight-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Centrobanca sets 500 billion lire eight-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers Banca Commerciale Italiano and J.P. Morgan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CENTROBANCA</p>
<p> AMT    500 BLN LIRE  BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY	 APR.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     12.5 BP   PAY DATE    10.APR.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY =	   ISS PRICE  100.09    FULL FEES   0.35</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   =	   REOFFER    99.89</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (M) 5	 SALE LIMITS US/GB/IT/CH</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 1</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ITALIAN   HOME CTRY  ITALY     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.15	SELL CONC  0.20	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658  </p>
<p> NOTES	BANCA POPOLARE NOVARA IS JOINT LEAD MANAGER</p>
